<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine ups China Resources warrants.</title>
<headline>Peregrine ups China Resources warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Tuesday it has increased the issue size of the American-style call warrants on China Resources Enterprise Ltd by 50 million warrants to 310 million warrants.</p>
<p>Terms of the warrant issue have been partially revised.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$6.12    PREMIUM     6.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.96    GEARING     1.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.AUG.97  SETTLEMENT  ABOUT 8 DAYS AFTER ISSUE</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG  BOARD LOT   20,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT  HK$14.80</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
